<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS FROM WTA TOUR CHASE CHAMPIONSHIPS ON TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS FROM WTA TOUR CHASE CHAMPIONSHIPS ON TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $2 million WTA Tour Chase Championships on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round Kimiko Date (Japan) beat 2-Monica Seles (U.S) 5-4 retired (due to shoulder injury)</p>
